# BE2OSM Data Processing
# Unified task runner for OSM import and GRB import
#
# Usage:
#   just <task>              Run a task
#   just --list              List all available tasks
#   just --list --unsorted   List tasks in the order they appear (grouped)
#
# Task Groups:
#   OSM:        OpenStreetMap data import from Geofabrik
#   GRB:        GRB data import from Digital Vlaanderen API
#   Database:   Database management and utilities
#   Maintenance: Optimization and cleanup tasks
#
# Note: Database schema is created automatically by postgres init scripts

# Default task - show help
